#sortorder:8
#showas:Zenith 冒险
This scenario is a great introduction to some of the new Zenith factions. 

The Dark Zenith Svikari are allied to the player, and will need your help in expanding their operations.  They can become a very powerful asset indeed when properly nurtured.  

The AI is a random "easier" AI type at difficulty 5. 

There are a couple of nomad planets roaming the galaxy. These will connect to nearby planets and disconnect when too far away. 

Finally, weak Zenith Miners will periodically appear to ravage or destroy a planet;  use your best judgement whether to prevent these assaults, or allow them to proceed.  